Select four Q8_0 floating-input mat-vec rows on AMD GCN. The pipeline workgroup denominator and specialization constant share q8_rows, so dispatch and shader coverage agree. Other quantization families retain their own row counts. This candidate changes all affected Q8 shapes, not only the output head.

